# ===== 114.50 Classical Languages IV =====
H('50.c.1.A',3,"A Latin IV student asks a question and adds a detail about time or place. This is a question with:","simple elaboration",["no content at all","a footnote only","a drawn map"],"Elaboration adds detail to a question or answer.")
H('50.c.1.A',2,"Which pair shows a question answered with simple elaboration?","Where is the temple? It stands near the old market.",["Where is the temple? Yes.","Where is the temple? Where is the temple?","Where is the temple? Maybe."],"The answer gives extra useful detail.")
H('50.c.1.B',3,"Saying that you prefer reading history to reading comedy is an example of:","expressing a personal preference",["quoting a law","giving a command","translating a coin"],"Opinions and preferences are exchanged in conversation.")
