H('50.c.2.A',3,"Which source is culturally authentic for a classical language class?","an inscription copied from a Roman monument",["a modern cartoon with no Latin","a cooking blog","a sports score"],"Authentic materials come from the ancient world or its tradition.")
H('50.c.2.A',3,"Analyzing an authentic audiovisual resource means:","looking closely at what it shows about the culture",["only counting its minutes","ignoring its content","memorizing its title"],"Analysis goes beyond surface description.")
