H('50.c.3.B',3,"Reading prose aloud with good phrasing means:","grouping words into meaningful units",["reading one letter at a time","ignoring commas","mumbling"],"Phrasing keeps ideas together.")

# ===== 114.51 Classical Languages Levels V-VII =====
