H('51.c.3.A',5,"An opinion supported by quotation from the original text is:","well justified",["unsupported","irrelevant","unreadable"],"Quoted evidence is strong justification.")
H('51.c.3.B',5,"Declamation is the skill of:","reading aloud with meter, meaning and expression",["silent copying","drawing letters","counting coins"],"Declamation is expressive oral delivery.")
