H('52.c.1.C',4,"Comprehending language within its cultural framework means interpreting it:","as people of that culture would",["by ignoring context","by guessing randomly","by deleting idioms"],"Culture shapes how language is understood.")
H('52.c.1.D',4,"An in-depth research paper should be built on:","evidence gathered from many sources",["one unchecked rumor","a single guess","no sources at all"],"Research papers rest on evidence.")
H('52.c.1.D',3,"A summary of a source should:","give its main points briefly",["copy every sentence","add invented facts","skip its topic"],"Summaries condense the main ideas.")
H('52.c.1.E',4,"After finishing research, a student can pose a new question to:","guide further study",["end all learning","erase the findings","hide the sources"],"Findings often raise new questions.")
H('52.c.1.E',3,"Which is a follow-up question drawn from a finding?","What other sources might explain this difference?",["What is two plus two?","Where is my pencil?","Is it lunch yet?"],"Follow-up questions extend inquiry.")
